    "detailed_description": "Have you ever wanted to relax and have a good smoke in an atmospheric village? Then you are exactly at the right place - take a drag on your cigarette and go ahead and explore our wonderful world. It doesn\u2019t matter whether you are an esthete or an amateur, everyone will find a piece of happiness in the Smoking Simulator, only here you can smoke a lot without any negative consequences, or you can go explore the atmospheric village, looking at the works of art on the walls and nature, as your heart desires.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n-You can smoke 24/7 without any penalties/negative consequences<br />\r\n-Relaxing soundtrack<br />\r\n-You can take a running jump into the snow from a hill without fear of crashing<br />\r\n-Atmosphere and humor<br />\r\n-Various references<br />\r\n-Beautiful next-gen graphics<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll similarities with real people, countries, places, etc. are purely coincidental. The game takes place in a fictional country - Cigaretteland.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy!)",
